						710220210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710220210,
					"content": "Well, I'd like to ask you to head to Tianqiu Valley to investigate that huge cavern and report on the impact of the earthquake on the surrounding environment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220211,
					"content": "As for the monsters... If it's true that they're appearing in great numbers, then we cannot afford to ignore them. We must decide on what countermeasures to take.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220212,
					"content": "Of course, this counts as official work for the Guild, and you will be compensated accordingly. What do you think?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220213,
					"content": "Hmm, judging by your expression... Did something happen?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220214,
					"content": "Oh, I've been there, alright...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710220215,
					"content": "Have you, now? Well, you are an elite adventurer, after all. It's no surprise that you follow the scent of danger wherever it leads you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220216,
					"content": "So, about the Primo Geovishaps and Tianqiu Valley...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710220217,
					"content": "...A giant cavern ruin with a Primo Geovishap within it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220218,
					"content": "Okay. I think I understand. Thank you for coming to me with this news. I'll handle the paperwork and make an official report to the Guild.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220219,
					"content": "What's with that area, anyway?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220220
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710220220,
					"content": "Hmm, according to some texts, Tianqiu Valley was once a prosperous settlement at some point in the ancient past.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220221,
					"content": "As to how it came to be the way it is now, it seems to have had something to do with the rampage of an ancient dragon king...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220222,
					"content": "There aren't a lot of details available about that incident, but legend has it that Rex Lapis and his adepti eventually imprisoned it within some sort of adepti realm.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220223,
					"content": "Its servants then fled into the depths of the earth and entered into a deep slumber, waiting for the day when the dragon king would rise again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220224,
					"content": "Does that mean that these monsters sightings...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710220225,
					"content": "Hahaha. Those are just folktales, you know? No one knows how true they are.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220226,
					"content": "Regardless, these constant earthquakes and the sudden appearance of those monsters are matters that demand our immediate attention.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710220227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				},
				{
					"id": 710220227,
					"content": "Right, please take this as your payment. Thank you for the information you provided.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiping"
				}
			]
		},
